tial interior design in Gurgaon?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Residential interior design can include space planning, furniture selection, lighting, colours, storage solutions, décor, material selection, and layout planning for different areas of a home.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">2. Can residential interiors be customized according to family requirements?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes, home interiors can be customized according to the family's lifestyle, preferences, daily routines, available space, furniture needs, storage requirements, and preferred design style.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">3. Do you provide interior design for apartments and villas?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes, residential interior design can be planned for apartments, villas, independent houses, family homes, and other residential properties according to their size, layout, and specific requirements.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">4. How does space planning improve a home's functionality?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Proper space planning considers furniture placement, movement, storage, lighting, and room usage. It helps make better use of available space while maintaining comfort and easy movement throughout the home.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">5. Do you provide end-to-end residential interior design services?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes, end-to-end services can include conceptual planning, space allocation, design development, material and furniture selection, coordination, and project execution support.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">6. Does Ninth Corner do commercial interior designs?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes,we also offer commercial interior designs besides home interior designs. For detailed information regarding our interior designing services, please visit our Interior Design Services page.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"learn-more-wrap\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/gurgaon/services.php\" class=\"learn-more-btn\">Learn More</a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <section class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Creating A Beautiful & Welcoming House</h2>\n            <p>A great-looking house not only looks beautiful, but it also complements your everyday tasks seamlessly. When every room’s design elements – lighting, furniture, storage, color, texture and layout – complement each other, the overall design of the house will come together beautifully, creating an atmosphere of comfortable and warm home interiors. Our designs by <a href=\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\">Ninth Corner</a> strive to create an inviting atmosphere while maintaining optimum function and true personalization, so your home not only looks good, but feels good too</p>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n"}